of the corresponding vectors:\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}3\\sqrt{2} & a \\\\ -\\sqrt{5} & 10\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThen, we find the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(M) & =|\\begin{aligned}3\\sqrt{2} & a \\\\ -\\sqrt{5} & 10\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =3\\sqrt{2}\\cdot 10-a\\cdot (-\\sqrt{5}) \\\\  & =30\\sqrt{2}+a\\sqrt{5}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, setting the expression for the determinant equal to $0$ and solving for $a,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}30\\sqrt{2}+a\\sqrt{5} & =0 \\\\ a\\sqrt{5} & =-30\\sqrt{2} \\\\ a & =-\\frac{30\\sqrt{2}}{\\sqrt{5}} \\\\ a & =-\\frac{30\\sqrt{2}}{\\sqrt{5}}\\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{\\sqrt{5}} \\\\ a & =-\\frac{30\\sqrt{10}}{5} \\\\ a & =-6\\sqrt{10}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534901 true] [17592186318439 1000 #edb/ref 17592186318440 13194139534901 true] [17592186318439 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534901 true] [17592186318439 1041 "field-1" 13194139534901 true] [17592186318439 1104 #edb/ref 17592186318440 13194139534901 true] [17592186318439 1110 #uuid "ff815ddc-e32f-5769-b372-2373baad5c21" 13194139534901 true] [17592186318440 1034 "-6\\sqrt{10}" 13194139534901 true] [17592186318440 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534901 true] [17592186318440 1111 #uuid "c32f8367-d095-5b0a-acdb-74ddb19bdabe" 13194139534901 true] [17592186318441 1034 "-2\\sqrt{7}" 13194139534901 true] [17592186318441 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534901 true] [17592186318441 1111 #uuid "5824f598-19e4-5f13-956f-26984dcfe33b" 13194139534901 true] [17592186318442 1017 #edb/ref 17592186318443 13194139534901 true] [17592186318442 1089 "q-69938" 13194139534901 true] [17592186318442 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139534901 true] [17592186318442 1100 "Calculate the area of the parallelogram spanned by $\\text{u}=⟨-2,3⟩$ and $\\text{v}=⟨4,-6⟩.$" 13194139534901 true] [17592186318442 1113 #uuid "fec406bd-1c02-5450-9bb3-294b965e105d" 13194139534901 true] [17592186318442 1145 "First, we construct a matrix where the columns are made up of the components of the corresponding vectors:\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}-2 & 4 \\\\ 3 & -6\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThen, we find the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(M) & =|\\begin{aligned}-2 & 4 \\\\ 3 & -6\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =(-2)\\cdot (-6)-4\\cdot 3 \\\\  & =12-12 \\\\  & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe absolute value of $det(M)$ gives the area $A$ of the parallelogram:\n\n$$\nA=|\\,0\\,|=0\n$$" 13194139534901 true] [17592186318443 1000 #edb/ref 17592186318444 13194139534901 true] [17592186318443 1000 #edb/ref 17592186318445 13194139534901 true] [17592186318443 1000 #edb/ref 17592186318446 13194139534901 true] [17592186318443 1000 #edb/ref 17592186318447 13194139534901 true] [17592186318443 1000 #edb/ref 17592186318448 13194139534901 true] [17592186318443 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534901 true] [17592186318443 1041 "selection" 13194139534901 true] [17592186318443 1104 #edb/ref 17592186318448 13194139534901 true] [17592186318443 1110 #uuid "c9264a88-2298-511f-a5ac-9b34c4534515" 13194139534901 true] [17592186318444 1034 "2" 13194139534901 true] [17592186318444 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534901 true] [17592186318444 1111 #uuid "82708d50-9b75-5ab6-953d-fd8e7e464fff" 13194139534901 true] [17592186318445 1034 "6" 13194139534901 true] [17592186318445 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534901 true] [17592186318445 1111 #uuid "0c3c279e-321f-502a-9f06-ca642f12c0e0" 13194139534901 true] [17592186318446 1034 "1" 13194139534901 true] [17592186318446 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534901 true] [17592186318446 1111 #uuid "cdb343e7-6744-57f7-95eb-b8163e9b56cd" 13194139534901 true] [17592186318447 1034 "4" 13194139534901 true] [17592186318447 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534901 true] [17592186318447 1111 #uuid "54fd7310-988b-54fd-86cc-5ad88ea5fddc" 13194139534901 true] [17592186318448 1034 "0" 13194139534901 true] [17592186318448 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534901 true] [17592186318448 1111 #uuid "c2bb3e70-ec30-58a2-a509-af52654b0fdd" 131